🚦 TrafficCore AI
Smart AI-Based Traffic Management System with Real-Time Monitoring & Adaptive Signal Control

TrafficCore AI is an intelligent traffic management system designed to optimize traffic flow at busy multi-directional intersections using AI-driven decision making, adaptive traffic light control, emergency vehicle prioritization, violation detection, and environmental monitoring.

The system simulates real-world traffic scenarios through dynamic signal timing adjustments, predictive traffic analysis, and interactive visual dashboards to improve efficiency, safety, and sustainability in urban transportation systems.

📌 Features
🚗 Real-Time Traffic Monitoring
Monitors traffic volume from four directions:
North
East
South
West
Tracks vehicle density and traffic conditions dynamically.
🤖 AI-Based Traffic Prediction
Simulated Machine Learning Traffic Predictor.
Predicts traffic volume using:
Time of day
Historical traffic trends
Weather conditions
Environmental factors
🚦 Adaptive Traffic Signal Control
Dynamically adjusts:
Green signal duration
Waiting times
Maintains optimized traffic flow using a 120-second traffic cycle.
🚑 Emergency Vehicle Prioritization
Detects emergency vehicles automatically.
Activates priority mode.
Provides dedicated signal clearance.
Generates voice alerts for operators.
🚨 Traffic Violation Detection

Detects:

Signal jumping
Speeding
Other traffic rule violations

Applies penalties and modifies signal behavior to improve compliance.

🌍 Environmental Monitoring

Tracks:

Air Quality Index (AQI)
Pollution levels
Horn usage

Generates AI recommendations such as:

Traffic diversions
Congestion mitigation strategies
📊 Analytics Dashboard

Provides:

Traffic statistics
Historical trends
Efficiency metrics
Violation reports
Performance visualization
🎙️ Voice Assistant Support
Real-time spoken alerts
Emergency notifications
Traffic updates using Web Speech API
🌙 Smart User Experience
Night Mode
Responsive UI
Simulation speed controls (0.5x – 5x)
Fullscreen camera view
Animated traffic visualization
🏗️ System Architecture
Raw Sensor Data
       │
       ▼
ML Traffic Predictor
       │
       ▼
Traffic Volume Calculation
       │
 ┌─────┴─────┐
 ▼           ▼
Emergency   Violation
Detection   Detection
      │      │
      └──┬───┘
         ▼
Signal Timing Optimization
         │
         ▼
Signal Control Execution
         │
         ▼
      UI Update

The system continuously monitors traffic conditions, predicts traffic volume, detects emergencies and violations, then dynamically updates traffic light timings to improve intersection efficiency.

