⚙️ Installation
Clone Repository
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/trafficcore-ai.git

cd trafficcore-ai
Install Dependencies
npm install
Start Development Server
npm start

Application will run on:

http://localhost:3000
📈 Performance Metrics

TrafficCore AI evaluates performance using:

Metric	Description
Efficiency	Measures overall traffic optimization
Average Wait Time	Average vehicle delay
Traffic Volume	Vehicles processed per cycle
Violation Count	Number of detected violations
Environmental Impact	Pollution and AQI monitoring

The simulated system achieves approximately:

⚡ 92% Traffic Efficiency
⏱️ Average Wait Time ~45 Seconds

under normal traffic conditions.

